                                "sense_id": "bd823588-81c0-3c03-bc20-0a4cffc10f00",
                                "text": "Man alien in a hostile world, engaged in a struggle which he cannot win while the world lasts, is assured that his foes are the foes also of Dryhten, that his courage noble in itself is also the highest loyalty: so said thyle and clerk."
